      <p class="wall-copy">When you want to change how you eat, starting with recipes isn’t helpful. They’re too detailed, and recipe websites are cluttered and full of ads.</p>
      <p class="wall-copy soft">Start instead with what you like and what you need to avoid. Let AI suggest breakfasts, lunches, dinners, and snacks that sound like you’d love them, then turn the ones you like into recipes.</p>
